error[E0208]: @doc is for declarations; it can't be composed into a decorator
 --> err_bundle_syntax.vuka:3:1
  |
3 | decorator A = @doc("x")
  | ^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: write decorator name(c) { … } or decorator Name = @a @b

